\" > Cards can evolve once their condition has been fulfilled, growing ever stronger </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy, trade and purge cards to tweak your deck to your liking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The <strong>16</strong> Minor Arcana cards support you - but don't underestimate their strength and necessity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What deck will you build?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/5fd743f258453272eb8ab7d8cd65d53a.avif?t=1731063197\" width=540 height=315 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/a596934b8c995d7beb9d893bae36d4c0.webp?t=1731063197\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/c12ada56561c9f3ae27e669ce8d73a1f.avif?t=1731063197\" width=246 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergies and find your playstyle - place your cards wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/79ad7c7f7f558ec9c929149fc25a6629.poster.avif?t=1731063197\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/79ad7c7f7f558ec9c929149fc25a6629.webm?t=1731063197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/79ad7c7f7f558ec9c929149fc25a6629.mp4?t=1731063197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/a596934b8c995d7beb9d893bae36d4c0.webp?t=1731063197\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/fe3ef0bc040330196def6f3f5dda4314.avif?t=1731063197\" width=321 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma is a distinctive resource that both you and the enemy must keep balanced at all times. Some cards may cost you karma, some may give it - but be careful, once you fall below zero, the debt is paid with your blood instead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/418cfe2d62bdc8be03f5a85688e712f8.poster.avif?t=1731063197\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/418cfe2d62bdc8be03f5a85688e712f8.webm?t=1731063197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/418cfe2d62bdc8be03f5a85688e712f8.mp4?t=1731063197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/a596934b8c995d7beb9d893bae36d4c0.webp?t=1731063197\" width=600 height=47 /></span><strong><i></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Venture forth - may the Wheel of Fortune spin ever in your favor.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852690/extras/45e72571964d9b6463eabf8156c4951f.poster.avif?t=1731063197\" width=150 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams